-- Goku · fan concept card, not for sale. Art supplied by the owner of this file.
-- Red and gold. Front: the art (with painted flames under Goku, goku_fire.py) fills the card inside a wide gold band,
-- the inscription engraved into the gold.
-- Back: gold line work on red (seigaiha scales, a fireball sun stamp with brand and number,
-- the seven dragon balls in medallions) inside the same engraved gold band as the front. Line art: goku_art.py.
create a card called goku, seed 1984.

make the window 976 by 1565, at 132 132, corners 14.

draw @goku-edge.svg called trim.
draw @goku-edge-text.svg called lore.
draw @goku-edge-grain.svg called grain.
draw @goku-back.svg called ornament.
draw @goku-scales.svg called scales.

sign "Goku" called signature-front, at 620 1600, 520 wide, size 160, tilted -4.
sign "Goku" called signature-back, at 620 1112, 420 wide, size 150, tilted -4.

define $gild as:
  outline it, 8 wide.
  emboss it, 0.2 mm high.
  plate it with gold.
  spray it with glitter in #f3d27a #e2b64e #fff0b8 #c99a3a, flakes 110 µm, density 0.7, 30 µm thick, overspray 0.
end.

on the front.
enamel the card in #a8141d.
print @goku-art-fire.png in the window, focused at 0.5 0.5.
emboss the trim, 0.12 mm high, soft 0.7.
plate the trim with gold.
etch the grain.
engrave the lore, 0.05 mm deep.
inlay the lore with #6e0c12, 0.02 mm deep.
spray the card with gloss, 30 µm thick.
use $gild on the signature-front.

on the back.
enamel the card in #a8141d.
emboss the trim, 0.12 mm high, soft 0.7.
plate the trim with gold.
etch the grain.
engrave the lore, 0.05 mm deep.
inlay the lore with #6e0c12, 0.02 mm deep.
plate the scales with gold.
emboss the ornament, 0.1 mm high, soft 0.6.
plate the ornament with gold.
spray the card with gloss, 30 µm thick.
use $gild on the signature-back.
